    10.742,
    "Integral proteins penetrate the core, and transmembrane ones span it, with nonpolar helices inside."
   ],
   [
    17.839,
    "The six jobs are transport, enzymes, signaling, recognition, joining, and attachment."
   ],
   [
    24.323,
    "And sugar chains, on glycoproteins and glycolipids, face outward, and work as identity badges."
   ],
   [
